testing resizeMutableByteArray#
starts unpinned:
first array ends unpinned, is a different array
second array ends unpinned, is a different array

starts pinned:
first array ends unpinned, is a different array
second array ends pinned, is the same array

starts aligned (8) & pinned:
first array ends unpinned, is a different array
second array ends pinned, is the same array

